<title>CHINA: Hong Kong dollar firm, market quiet.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong dollar firm, market quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>USD/HKG  7.7405/15   O'NIGHT  6.12     3MO  HKD/USD SPREAD  +134</p>
<p>USD/THB  31.83/89    3MO SWAP 260	2YR  HKD/USD SPREAD   +70</p>
<p>USD/PHP  28.47/50    6MO SWAP 480	10YR HKD/USD SPREAD   +58</p>
<p>USD/MYR  2.6350/00   USD/JPY 117.25/35 USD/IDR  2585.00/2595</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>* Hong Kong dollar, money market relatively quiet</p>
<p>* Spot Hong Kong dollar rate firmer, interbank rates firmer on liquidation of U.S. dollar positions</p>
<p>* Dealers said uncertainty would persist for at least two more weeks unless Thailand announces credible measures to sort out its economic difficulties  </p>
<p>* Thailand's agreement &quot;in principle&quot; to accept financial assistance from the International Monetary Fund viewed as positive by market</p>
<p>* Yields on Exchange Fund notes: 3yr 6.56 percent; 5yr 6.62 percent; 7yr 6.66 percent; one week 6.30 percent</p>
<p>-- Sarah Davison (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
